{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "7b14fc9bfd712ffca3790045f36a86fa2cae56d13282615212c5fe84ac1336cb", "ja": "{$P$}Pさんって、\n今年の夏は、どう過ごすのかな？\n長期休暇とか、あるのかな？", "zh": "不晓得{$P$}P先生\n会怎么度过今年的夏天呢？\n会给自己放个长假吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "9d9ce209bebf6074420ed337807f2c9c0122484346b808b422214db0d7692c03", "ja": "イベントが多くて大変そうだけど、\nそういうときこそ、\n息抜きが必要だよね……。", "zh": "活动这么多，他应该很多事要忙，\n不过这种时候才更需要\n去休息放松呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "663e0d1da2b49a6164099b3ff0548a98f31c91ce968106aa3fc7d04d8e366026", "ja": "そうだ！　劇場のみんなでレジャー\nに行ったら、いいリフレッシュに\nなるかも♪　計画してみよう！", "zh": "对了！不如让剧场的大家一起出去玩，\n搞不好很有放松的效果♪\n来规划一下好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
